OVERVIEW: Convert DICOM files to HL7 v2 messages

Extract demographics, study info, and other data from DICOM files
and generate HL7 v2 messages (ADT, ORM, ORU).

USAGE: dicom-gateway dicom-to-hl7 <input> [--output <output>] [--message-type <message-type>] [--event-type <event-type>] [--verbose]

ARGUMENTS:
  <input>                 Input DICOM file

OPTIONS:
  -o, --output <output>   Output HL7 file path
  -t, --message-type <message-type>
                          HL7 message type: ADT, ORM, ORU (default: ADT)
  --event-type <event-type>
                          ADT event type (e.g., A01, A02, A03) (default: A01)
  -v, --verbose           Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

